# PC card team-path (docs/plan-team-top5.md section 12, TMODE-25/26, BENCH-124): the picked table (mk) against aa on the picked teams, fresh seeds. Template: tpprep writes work/team-path-gate.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml
--team
true
--seeds
16
--seed-base
5000
--rounds
10
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
work/team-path-gate.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur2.HadurTeam_@V@mk.jar
--robot
